or su esposa, quien desea asistir a un evento que Nicolás se niega a ir, pero cambia de opinión repentinamente al saber que el evento no es otro que la misma subasta de arte a la que Sergio invitó a Victoria." type="episode" contentRating="NONADULT" duration="3070000" grandparentArt="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766385.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/67a0b759cb3d68c83b1e7d4f" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/67a0b759cb3d68c83b1e7d4f" grandparentRatingKey="67a0b759cb3d68c83b1e7d4f" grandparentThumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1766385.jpg" grandparentTitle="La Trepadora" grandparentType="show" index="104" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766385.jpg" title="S01:E104" userState="0"><Image alt="S01:E104" type="coverArt" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766385.jpg"/><Image alt="S01:E104" type="coverPoster" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1766385.jpg"/><Image alt="S01:E104" type="snapshot" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766385.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" id="6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" ratingKey="genre_6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" slug="bingeworthy" tag="Bingeworthy" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1781267533" duration="3070000" endsAt="1781270603" id="6a236a7869d52d5c0ed9cd4b" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1781297463" duration="3070000" endsAt="1781300533" id="6a236a7869d52d5c0ed9cd55" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a2218ef7845c0e000edc5b2" key="/library/metadata/6a2218ef7845c0e000edc5b2" ratingKey="6a2218ef7845c0e000edc5b2" summary="Carlos Raúl le advierte a Adriana que ante tantas adversidades deben estar preparados para todo lo malo y fortalecer su amor." type="episode" contentRating="NONADULT" duration="3090000" grandparentArt="https